# Copy resources

Ordinary wording lives in `src/mouse_click_stability_analyzer/resources/strings/`.

## Copy-only task

May edit page JSON under `resources/strings/` except `terminology.json`. Must not edit Python. Must not rename JSON keys or placeholders.

## UI-layout task

May edit Qt layout/style. Must not edit `resources/strings/**` unless explicitly requested.

## Terminology task

Shared engineering terms live in `terminology.json`. Page files reference them with `{@term.key}`. Read `note`/`help` before changing a term. Do not duplicate a canonical term’s exact wording in page files.

## Report

HTML/XLSX labels are `report.json` English only. Do not invent Chinese report copy.
